{
  "slug": "gedcom-genealogy-skills",
  "name": "Gedcom Genealogy Skills",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "A set of skills that teach Claude how to work with GEDCOM genealogy files.  You can search through GEDCOM databases, show individuals' details, and make changes to the database all from within Claude.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **4 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (4): `ancestor-report` (Use when the user asks to generate, build, or write a genealogy report, ancestor report, ancestry report, or…), `read-gedcom` (Use when the user asks to read, open, summarize, inspect, view, parse, or describe a GEDCOM file (`.ged`…), `search-gedcom` (Use when the user asks to find, search, look up, query, list-matching, locate, or filter records in a…), `update-gedcom` (Use when the user asks to edit, modify, change, update, set, alter, fix, correct, add, remove, or delete…)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install gedcom-genealogy-skills@claude-community` from `vaelen/gedcom-skills`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "antigravity",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "wrapper",
  "wrapper": "skill",
  "sourceType": "community",
